    "title": "DJI Store - Try Virtual Flight",
    "description": "A must-have smartphone app for DJI users\r\n\u3010Device Management\u3011\r\n1. Track usage and check remaining DJI Care days. \r\n2. One-stop online after-sales service for repairs, replacements, and flyaway scenarios. \r\n3. Enhance your skills with online courses. \r\n4. Resolve issues with official guides.\r\n\u3010Elevate Your Creation\u3011\r\n1. Virtual Flight: Fun practice before the actual flight.\r\n2. DJI Forum: Exchange ideas and find answers to your questions.\r\n3. SkyPixel: Share your creations and experience new products.\r\n\u3010Comprehensive Product Selection\u3011\r\n1. Newest DJI products.\r\n2. All accessories.\r\n\u3010Exclusive Benefits\u3011\r\n1. Shopping rewards in the form of DJI Credit, which can be used to pay for purchases from the DJI Online Store.\r\n2. Exclusive gifts with purchase, including limited DJI merchandise for select products.\r\n3. Early notice for exclusive monthly discounts.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAbout DJI\r\nSince its establishment in 2006, DJI has given the world groundbreaking innovations in drones, handheld imaging, robotics education, and much more, reshaping entire industries and improving lives. DJI works tirelessly with partners from across the globe to usher in an era of spatial intelligence beyond imagination.\r\nContact us at: www.dji.com/contact",
